			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Dependency updates and documentation formatting pass\n\nUpdate twelve element submodules to synchronize dependency versions and apply documentation formatting improvements:\n\n**Common** (deps/docs): Bump @cloudflare/workers-types from 4.20260526.1 to 4.20260529.1. Apply soft-wrap formatting to Architecture.md and README.md lines describing transport layer implementations (gRPCTransport, IPCTransport, WASMTransport, MistTransport) for improved readability.\n\n**Echo** (deps): Update Cloudflare development dependencies — @cloudflare/workers-types 4.20260528.1 → 4.20260529.1 and wrangler 4.94.0 → 4.95.0 via Dependabot.\n\n**Grove** (docs): Synchronize markdown table column alignment in DeepDive.md Integration Points section to match visual style of Documentation/GitHub folder.\n\n**Mountain** (docs): Standardize Core Modules audit table column spacing in GitHub Naming Conventions documentation for consistent GitHub rendering.\n\n**Rest** (fix/chore): Restore nightly-only rustflags for aarch64 and x86_64 targets. Bump minimum Node.js requirement from v18 to v24 in package.json to align with development environment (Node v26.2.0 via NVM).\n\n**Sky** (deps): Upgrade Astro from 6.3.8 to 6.4.2 for upstream bug fixes and performance improvements. No breaking changes within 6.x major version.\n\n**Vine** (docs): Normalize column widths in Architecture.md Protocol Files table and DeepDive.md Integration Points table. Remove unused commit_message.json file from root directory.\n\n**Maintain, Output, SideCar, Wind, Worker**: Submodule synchronization with no new descriptive commits.\n\nAll changes are dependency updates, documentation formatting, or build pipeline alignment with no functional behavior changes.",
