			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Formatting pass and documentation cleanup\n\nUpdate seven element submodules to apply consistent code formatting and remove deprecated architecture references:\n\n**Air** (style/docs): Add blank lines for visual separation in control flow blocks across 25 Rust source files. Remove deprecated `Plugins` and `Mountain` module references from README documentation following recent refactoring.\n\n**Common** (style/docs): Insert empty lines between variable declarations in LanguageFeature provider files and telemetry modules. Refactor transport layer documentation to reflect trait-based `TransportStrategy` abstraction delegated to Grove.\n\n**Grove** (docs): Remove deprecated `Source/API/`, `Source/Common/`, `Source/Services/`, and `Proto/Grove.proto` references from architecture documentation. Update sequence diagrams to specify \"gRPC via Vine\" instead of Grove-specific protocols.\n\n**Maintain** (style): Add blank lines between struct fields and module declarations in Eliminate transform CLI components.\n\n**Mountain** (refactor): Normalize import separation by standardizing canonical library imports versus local `crate::` bindings. Consolidate module documentation by removing dead code and dormant scaffolding including unused `TlsCommands`, `EmitWithTraceparent`, and other dormant RPC dispatch arms.\n\n**Vine** (docs): Remove dead Grove references from architecture documentation following Grove WASM extension host removal. Streamline gRPC topology documentation to Mountain ↔ Cocoon and Mountain ↔ Air.\n\n**Worker** (style): Apply consistent formatting across ESBuild configuration files and Service Worker source with standardized whitespace and property ordering.\n\nAll changes are cosmetic or documentation updates with no functional behavior changes except Mountain's removal of dormant RPC arms.",
